= Rush Medical College at Rush University - Prompt 03

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Distance Traveled - Effect and Growth
- Limit: 1000 characters
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Med School Insiders
- Source: https://medschoolinsiders.com/medical-school-secondary-prompts-database/rush-medical-college-secondary-essay-prompts/
